 **Module Federation - OPERATIONAL**\n- Federation config file created\n- Remote module loading successfully\n- Component extraction working\n- React sharing configured properly\n\n✅ **Client-Side Rendering - VERIFIED**\n- Main UI loads with full HTML content\n- Theme system functional (Radix Themes + blue accent)\n- Configuration panel accessible\n- Loading states working properly\n- Error boundaries in place\n\n🔧 **Technical Fixes:**\n1. Fixed API URL undefined error (AUTH_CHECK endpoint)\n2. Resolved ESLint useEffect dependencies warning\n3. Fixed webpack dev server crash (ERR_HTTP_HEADERS_SENT)\n4. Configured proper Module Federation sharing\n5. Created missing federation configuration file\n6. Resolved port conflicts between services\n\n📊 **Current Status:**\n- ✅ API: http://localhost:8080 (healthy)\n- ✅ Federation: http://localhost:3001 (serving remoteEntry.js)\n- ✅ Main UI: http://localhost:3000 (loading with content)\n- ✅ Module Federation: Working (components loading)\n- ✅ Theme System: Functional (Radix UI + Themes)\n- ✅ Configuration Panel: Accessible\n\n🎉 **RESULT:** Application is now fully functional with working\nfederation, theme system, and all core features operational.","tree":{"sha":"fd4d121a79e58ee67b188e1636071b8370de8f27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agoat-io/agoat-vendor-v2/git/trees/fd4d121a79e58ee67b188e1636071b8370de8f27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/agoat-io/agoat-vendor-v2/git/commits/277cf53dc90d994e2d95640eab25e18907de3af0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173555660?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoat-vendors/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoat-vendors/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoat-vendors/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agoat-vendors/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"