MTQ1MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewdyer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewdyer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewdyer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewdyer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewdyer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewdyer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andrewdyer/react-vite-turborepo-template/commits/81709f26da2f786b2a5853672750224061b66813/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T22:22:27Z","email":"andrewdyer@outlook.com","name":"Andrew Dyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T22:22:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(workflows): update token handling and permissions (#29)\n\n* fix: add token input handling\n\nChange NODE_AUTH_TOKEN to use the provided token input instead of the default GitHub token.\n\n* fix: add permissions for workflow\n\nAdd permissions for contents and packages to the workflow.\n\n* fix: add token handling for package installation\n\nAdd token input for GitHub Packages in publish and test workflows.\n\n* fix: update NODE_AUTH_TOKEN to use secret\n\nChange NODE_AUTH_TOKEN in Docker image build step to use the secret for improved security.\n\n* fix: remove default token value\n\nIn metadata, values are treated as literals so the default `github.token` won’t be evaluated and can end up being passed through as the literal string.\n\n* fix: make token input required\n\nEnsure that the token input is mandatory for authentication during package installation.\n\n* fix: remove redundant token input definition\n\nEliminate duplicate token input definition in action.yml.\n\n* fix: update action description for pnpm install\n\nClarify that GitHub Packages auth is required for dependency installation.\n\n* ci: add secret validation for tokens\n\nImplement validation steps for PACKAGES_READ_TOKEN and RELEASE_PLEASE_TOKEN in workflows.\n\n* fix: add token validation step for pnpm install\n\nEnsure that the token input is provided before proceeding with the installation.\n\n* fix: update token input to be optional\n\nChange token input from required to optional and update action description for clarity.\n\n* fix: remove token validation step from workflows\n\nEliminate the validation step for PACKAGES_READ_TOKEN in publish and test workflows.\n\n* fix: update workflow triggers and concurrency settings\n\nChange workflow to trigger on pull requests and add concurrency management.\n\n* fix: remove token validation step from workflows\n\nEliminate the validation step for PACKAGES_READ_TOKEN in publish and test workflows.","tree":{"sha":"5a9bf97f79d7e700beaeb180ed9c3c7768b9e20e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andrewdyer/react-vite-turborepo-template/git/trees/5a9bf97f79d7e700beaeb180ed9c3c7768b9e20e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andrewdyer/react-vite-turborepo-template/git/commits/81709f26da2f786b2a5853672750224061b66813","verification":{"payload":"tree 5a9bf97f79d7e700beaeb180ed9c3c7768b9e20e\nparent eaed6895ed9c484cc96b80659f65f41b22b5dbb0\nauthor Andrew Dyer <andrewdyer@outlook.com> 1783030947 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783030947 +0100\n\nchore(workflows): update token handling and permissions (#29)\n\n* fix: add token input handling\n\nChange NODE_AUTH_TOKEN to use the provided token input instead of the default GitHub token.\n\n* fix: add permissions for workflow\n\nAdd permissions for contents and packages to the workflow.\n\n* fix: add token handling for package installation\n\nAdd token input for GitHub Packages in publish and test workflows.\n\n* fix: update NODE_AUTH_TOKEN to use secret\n\nChange NODE_AUTH_TOKEN in Docker image build step to use the secret for improved security.\n\n* fix: remove default token value\n\nIn metadata, values are treated as literals so the default `github.token` won’t be evaluated and can end up being passed through as the literal string.\n\n* fix: make token input required\n\nEnsure that the token input is mandatory for authentication during package installation.\n\n* fix: remove redundant token input definition\n\nEliminate duplicate token input definition in action.yml.\n\n* fix: update action description for pnpm install\n\nClarify that GitHub Packages auth is required for dependency installation.\n\n* ci: add secret validation for tokens\n\nImplement validation steps for PACKAGES_READ_TOKEN and RELEASE_PLEASE_TOKEN in workflows.\n\n* fix: add token validation step for pnpm install\n\nEnsure that the token input is provided before proceeding with the installation.\n\n* fix: update token input to be optional\n\nChange token input from required to optional and update action description for clarity.\n\n* fix: remove token validation step from workflows\n\nEliminate the validation step for PACKAGES_READ_TOKEN in publish and test workflows.\n\n* fix: update workflow triggers and concurrency settings\n\nChange workflow to trigger on pull requests and add concurrency management.\n\n* fix: remove token validation step from workflows\n\nEliminate the validation step for PACKAGES_READ_TOKEN in publish and test workflows.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRuSjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASIIQABSWjB7lFxutCVPYooYEDTti\nZSWYM80lsJ4vHIC9utmlCFVZZflXwo6pJzj2bLwf+hJrIsDYSweCtbj70QwQTq64\nzaiyNDlvjBLanJIJRS1QvkNr0cCUEahQaUjkwHO0cGKn27Me98nEbFfdjfKN4q2o\nSPcZgHIF4YkUqpaF5OuD6GKkHEllNBfZ7euRb7Xpt+uhUtRFlak3tgN8W0Ot5ZjP\n20s2a9oGJU+syKnFoCkrmtslKK8DzpOpW84OaEIPzMVWtiO+4d8/063IseOrTsmd\nA4heBl8oeTuPL91n/W38mxCjnfmbO95dZM1ltdWRMqVFCYJQZkkvvtjUdWf8aA4C\nDn/kWMMzHX6w9y6mMtmplDwWpcNjy70Qxtc+B7Zujm1DZcPkt9mNWMZagWYcfL/2\nyDIkRKTIwfa2Ow5tyMh3C30MpYWWPw+76cfRMZmPJXaqKjIS36w2jOOxtq1e4AnC\nxwiFBoaNoakpl40z/IephScd6UGuYRyDZXcXY2jEXlHhGvRGeDfcSO+5ME4E9fvZ\nKwAxMb3UZrgzpKuUUKPRbk5kgWqybtUU