yer <andrewdyer@outlook.com> 1781875527 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781875527 +0100\n\nchore: add pull request template (#21)\n\n* chore: add pull request template\n\nCreate a standardized template for pull requests to ensure consistent information and adherence to guidelines.\n\n* docs:: update commit message scope examples\n\nClarify the format for specifying workspace scopes in commit messages.\n\n* docs: update scope examples in commit guidelines\n\nClarify that the scope should reflect affected workspaces from apps or packages.\n\n* docs: update pull request template links\n\nCorrect links in the pull request template for feature, bug fix, and dependencies.\n\n* docs: update pull request templates for clarity\n\nClarify PR title formatting instructions for bugfix, feature, and dependency templates.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNUNHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJNIQAI30kzGzIt4C1f5m8XajkAYP\nH58OM0lyQcxpbg1nV74pSye8L5n1VfLIms1S5bDhXNboPCpfA0ypBkYtWFLVYlz3\nn2yu+7mlnEypIZ50OSCrJp9h79t92HfgIlnn2a8xm9e2nn2XVZ0zUZkn+pPVOTc6\nELD4pr+BPlFPR3+8SenBTuiw1KzJZyWpsk44LYSV7uAqNS2T3Z6KPF++RtvJEQOc\nN/vYrds6XqcCst+7sioNMRAFHqns5jXerjAHpjx4mRJ5ssL4//txZx21xb6iXC2G\ngGsVaWA7r8Teo8xRLRnD6ZF+Zlhe+D5jtKfXEdF/Xs2ONlk0jdnIRKjdn4fXnei2\nURbxdHL1/4e3E3qIg6qCK0XM6gt4g/74SmyT0h2RPX4aAbhsfL5mPbSEh0nTWKcV\nSJ3kvlcYgSqWL/urYfVZmLlY0HkwmPTarlAQdWoKXlCEQaRHdb2bBhTu7bdm81hp\n2Y+LaMvJO9orpQnaAIgwIoOJvBj+4MWfUnXiP7a7+GAII1xA1t/WrqShM8pJfWvt\n3TEo8DkBuVvumJlZtj8HWb4mfiXNUrtOdvewYwa0pFV/eoC7pkdAoa+Hbd4S80GK\nUtIpLKUatGLdXLJBT8hqgC0dt2R+BUvo8ZJaL/d/7rKevH2lLUeW+EZItLgZp3s3\njwWoH+83MBp1lQpL3KlI\n=vglu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-19T13:25:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users