for Playwright setup\n\nRemoved Playwright caching and installation steps from CI workflow. Added e2e:setup script to Turbo configuration for better dependency management.\n\n* chore: :wrench: update Node.js version to 22 in CI configuration\n\nThis change ensures compatibility with the latest features and improvements in Node.js 22.\n\n* chore: :wrench: update web server command in Playwright configuration\n\nChanged the web server command from ''pnpm --filter web dev'' to ''pnpm --filter web preview'' for improved functionality.\n\n* chore: :wrench: add Playwright browser installation step in CI workflow\n\nThis update includes the installation of Playwright browsers in the CI process and removes the redundant e2e setup script from the web-e2e package.json.\n\n* chore: :wrench: update web server command to use ''preview'' in Playwright config\n\nChanged the web server command in the Playwright configuration to ''pnpm --filter web preview'' for improved testing setup.\n\n* chore: :wrench: update baseURL and web server URL in Playwright config\n\nAdjusted the baseURL and web server URL to ensure consistency with the preview port settings.\n\n* chore: :wrench: update Playwright browser installation command in CI workflow\n\nReplaced the command to install Playwright browsers to use ''pnpm dlx'' for improved compatibility.\n\n* chore: :wrench: add caching for Playwright browsers in CI workflow\n\nThis change introduces a caching step for Playwright browsers to optimize the CI workflow by reducing installation time.\n\n* chore: :wrench: update Playwright browser installation command in CI workflow\n\nReplaced ''pnpm dlx'' with ''npx'' for installing Playwright browsers to ensure compatibility and streamline the installation process.\n\n* chore: :wrench: update Playwright browser installation command in CI workflow\n\nChanged the command to install Playwright browsers to use pnpm with the appropriate filter for E2E tests.","tree":{"sha":"4dc1dde5678bb4d8548540976ad5fd2b