T20:52:49Z","email":"andrewdyer@outlook.com","name":"Andrew Dyer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-06T20:52:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: :wrench: fix lint-staged (#4)\n\n* chore: :wrench: move lint-staged to individual apps\n\nFixes errors and stash issues by configuring lint-staged\nper workspace instead of root-level. Prettier stays global,\nESLint runs locally in each package.\n\n* fix: :bug: correct lint-staged filter paths in pre-commit hook\n\nUpdated the pre-commit hook to use the correct filter paths for lint-staged in the web and web-e2e applications. Also formatted the lint-staged configuration in package.json for consistency.\n\n* fix: :bug: correct lint-staged filter paths in package.json\n\nUpdated lint-staged configuration to ensure proper file matching for ESLint and Prettier in both web and web-e2e applications.\n\n* fix: :bug: update lint-staged filter paths in package.json\n\nChanged lint-staged configuration to match the correct file patterns for linting.\n\n* fix: :bug: reorder lint-staged configurations in package.json\n\nMoved the eslint --fix command to ensure proper execution order in lint-staged.\n\n* fix: :bug: remove unnecessary flag from prettier command in lint-staged\n\nSimplified the prettier command in lint-staged configurations for both web and web-e2e packages by removing the --ignore-unknown flag.","tree":{"sha":"ec97c06d82893e5237fe748881189bfb8eb3a715","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andrewdyer/react-vite-turborepo-template/git/trees/ec97c06d82893e5237fe748881189bfb8eb3a715"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andrewdyer/react-vite-turborepo-template/git/commits/6650b7491ed1dbcae25d6aa27f6e783327f9ba4c","verification":{"payload":"tree ec97c06d82893e5237fe748881189bfb8eb3a715\nparent 03a0dac5807b9a18602f56f12ad1ff20c2297e84\nauthor Andrew Dyer <andrewdyer@outlook.com> 1759783969 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1759783969 +0100\n\nchore: :wrench: fix lint-staged (#4)\n\n* chore: :wrench: move lint-staged to individual apps\n\nFixes errors and stash issues by configuring lint-staged\nper workspace instead of root-level. Prettier stays global,\nESLint runs locally in each package.\n\n* fix: :bug: correct lint-staged filter paths in pre-commit hook\n\nUpdated the pre-commit hook to use the correct filter paths for lint-staged in the web and web-e2e applications. Also formatted the lint-staged configuration in package.json for consistency.\n\n* fix: :bug: correct lint-staged filter paths in package.json\n\nUpdated lint-staged configuration to ensure proper file matching for ESLint and Prettier in both web and web-e2e applications.\n\n* fix: :bug: update lint-staged filter paths in package.json\n\nChanged lint-staged configuration to match the correct file patterns for linting.\n\n* fix: :bug: reorder lint-staged configurations in package.json\n\nMoved the eslint --fix command to ensure proper execution order in lint-staged.\n\n* fix: :bug: remove unnecessary flag from prettier command in lint-staged\n\nSimplified the prettier command in lint-staged configurations for both web and web-e2e packages by removing the --ignore-unknown flag.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJo5CwhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuhkQAKFj6D4MoheoGYULvm5THjO5\n43c8ojOiB2D5L3VTA+caOlPVmKuP6BmWjhR8eIY+gD/p4C5RtjCUPylfHSpz9WCZ\nMOK6X2jabyKKY3RogxIkjgw3fdqCceSk8PYaxUWBFtvnsGxc6yqlnyi7X5wFVizN\nZs99jBpzbQZhMG0mVNe2NpOyRhJeyPh61g2F2hm5PYYvbWHFhZAF82lew9SlUOQ+\nu3+ZF6T+XU1FAzFCez+MnhNESMOR+qM7CLONW3i6HiuRJHqgBztjwrQEW+d81EgO\n5bLSnOFHamN4SwBF5Kmfo+aOdssO1nWgOxrryfindYrJal1U/yRx2w3ziH8TPng5\ndXWJYgMBTwGkWKzaiDqk4CaEw2I7MHKdza+KEbQl33BjW25onf4uTnZG9ClQ4GEO\ngzq+kuUUP/kypGsiiyjj0TqQQwHHRPtIzNE6Sy8u9xrQX6ypj+XVwf6K+xlCa/cs\nUupGNICy9RHUU/IFT393ME4uZmag0BPdHSPlRphuWemQb65rmXK882AraU3zd8um\njFrqohyL5DOQNCPHdrFaQfq6ENemc8ChpVJ5pfkQVMiEA3b7ukZ+JohZ27r2GpRV\nNTyf8VMDcbF9lzvILaKXs+O8KND4A19Rd7TOLUoDEhN55CM3n5rbEIduCHk3fmJn\ndnqtHsIGJOhkSFe