rench: update pnpm version to latest in CI workflow\n\nThis change ensures that the CI workflow uses the latest version of pnpm for better compatibility and features.","tree":{"sha":"b236fa948a93245993ad373aa4d1ad57bb69aec7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andrewdyer/react-vite-turborepo-template/git/trees/b236fa948a93245993ad373aa4d1ad57bb69aec7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/andrewdyer/react-vite-turborepo-template/git/commits/03a0dac5807b9a18602f56f12ad1ff20c2297e84","verification":{"payload":"tree b236fa948a93245993ad373aa4d1ad57bb69aec7\nparent 674bdaf9bad92cb7f93a106cb8187f8812f21eaa\nauthor Andrew Dyer <andrewdyer@outlook.com> 1759502053 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1759502053 +0100\n\nfeat: :sparkles: add CI workflow for build and test (#2)\n\n* feat: :sparkles: add CI workflow for build and test\n\nThis commit introduces a new CI workflow that automates the build and test processes on push and pull request events for the main branch.\n\n* feat: :sparkles: enhance CI workflow and add E2E testing support\n\nUpdated CI configuration to include unit and E2E tests, increased timeout, and improved build steps. Added E2E script to package.json and defined E2E task in turbo.json for better integration.\n\n* fix: :bug: correct Playwright installation command in CI workflow\n\nUpdated the command to install Playwright browsers from ''pnpm exec'' to ''npx'' for better compatibility.\n\n* fix: :bug: correct Playwright installation command in CI workflow\n\nReplaced ''npx'' with ''pnpm dlx'' for installing Playwright browsers to ensure consistency with the package manager used in the workflow.\n\n* chore: :wrench: update pnpm version to latest in CI workflow\n\nThis change ensures that the CI workflow uses the latest version of pnpm for better compatibility and features.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJo397lCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiRQQAAfeuJ8nCwJhfcdd10q2pYHV\nEjBWx67s/p2EYcSpKf6EY32pzn+YC5USdLfVSpiu61sIO