","name":"Long"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-24T07:59:27Z","email":"4801104085@student.hcmue.edu.vn","name":"Long"},"message":"feat: handle OAuth callback directly on homepage\n\n✅ Changes:\n- Home page now handles OAuth callback params (success=true&user={...})\n- Detects OAuth redirect from backend\n- Logs in user automatically using received user data\n- Cleans up URL by removing query params using history.replaceState\n- Shows success toast notification\n\n🔄 Flow:\n1. Backend redirects to /?success=true&user={userData}\n2. Home.tsx detects query params\n3. Parses user data from URL\n4. Calls login() to save user state\n5. Shows success toast\n6. Cleans up URL\n7. User sees homepage immediately\n\n📝 Added:\n- useSearchParams from react-router-dom for parsing query params\n- useAuth hook to access login() function\n- OAuth callback handler useEffect in Home.tsx\n\n✨ Benefits:\n- Seamless UX: user redirected directly to homepage after login\n- No extra page navigation required\n- Cleaner URL after login (query params removed)","tree":{"sha":"e72bbad947c5413f5890436f02a6a16249914de7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/git/trees/e72bbad947c5413f5890436f02a6a16249914de7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/git/commits/9b96866207f7e655bd75d2b74f5676a7129dcc94","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121165459?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quoclong20222428","id":121165459,"login":"quoclong20222428","node_id":"U_kgD