users/quoclong20222428/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/commits/8a283cc94cd5665d678ad99afcb3b229b62f1b4a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-24T07:22:19Z","email":"4801104085@student.hcmue.edu.vn","name":"Long"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-24T07:22:19Z","email":"4801104085@student.hcmue.edu.vn","name":"Long"},"message":"fix: prevent 401 errors by only calling /auth/me when user is logged in\n\n❌ Issue:\n- AuthContext was calling /auth/me on every app mount\n- Even when user hasn''t logged in yet, causing 401 Unauthorized error\n- Error log showed: Failed to load resource: 401 from /api/auth/me\n- Unnecessary server calls for non-authenticated users\n\n✅ Solution:\n- Only call /auth/me if user data exists in localStorage (user is logged in)\n- Handle 401 error gracefully: clear user session if expired\n- Skip /auth/me call entirely if no saved user (not logged in)\n- Keep user data from localStorage if other errors occur (network issues)\n\n🔄 Flow:\n1. App mounts\n2. Check if user data in localStorage\n3. If yes: verify session with /auth/me\n   - Success: update user state\n   - 401: clear session (token expired)\n   - Other errors: keep localStorage user (network issues)\n4. If no: skip /auth/me (user not logged in)\n5. Set loading to false\n\n📝 Changes:\n- AuthContext.tsx: Improved session restoration logic with proper error handling","tree":{"sha":"1fd2d7bb7b9dd8306c15750e2febcca7fb744062","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/git/trees/1fd2d7bb7b9dd8306c15750e2febcca7fb744062"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/git/commits/8a283cc94cd5665d678ad99afcb3b229b62f1b4a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121165459?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quoclong20222428","id":121165459,"login":"quoclong20222428","node_id":"U_kgDOBzjWkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/commit/8a283cc94cd5665d678ad99afcb3b229b62f1b4a","node_id":"C_kwDOP7clw9oAKDhhMjgzY2M5NGNkNTY2NWQ2NzhhZDk5YWZjYjNiMjI5YjYyZjFiNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/commit/0f36624d9741c314963e9e474a61fa94edd0de3f","sha":"0f36624d9741c314963e9e474a61fa94edd0de3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/commits/0f36624d9741c314963e9e474a61fa94edd0de3f"}],"sha":"8a283cc94cd5665d678ad99afcb3b229b62f1b4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/commits/8a283cc94cd5665d678ad99afcb3b229b62f1b4a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121165459?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quoclong20222428","id":121165459,"login":"quoclong20222428","node_id":"U_kgDOBzjWkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/commits/0f36624d9741c314963e9e474a61fa94edd0de3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-24T07:14:48Z","email":"4801104085@student.hcmue.edu.vn","name":"Long"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-24T07:14:48Z","email":"4801104085@student.hcmue.edu.vn","name":"Long"},"message":"refactor: replace import.meta.url with direct SVG imports for better build compatibility\n\n✅ Changes:\n- Replace dynamic import.meta.url approach with direct SVG imports\n- Direct imports: import ClearDay from ''./clear-day.svg''\n- Vite handles SVG optimization and asset hashing at build time\n- More reliable for production builds across different environments\n\n🔧 Benefits:\n- Better compatibility with Vite build process\n- Proper asset hashing in production\n- Consistent behavior between dev and build\n- No dependency on import.meta.url handling\n\n📊 Impact:\n- SVG icons properly bundled and hashed in production\n- Vercel builds now have correct asset paths\n- More predictable asset delivery","tree":{"sha":"ba4125202a0e503a4ed906755c09acda52601d2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/git/trees/ba4125202a0e503a4ed906755c09acda52601d2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/git/commits/0f36624d9741c314963e9e474a61fa94edd0de3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121165459?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quoclong20222428","id":121165459,"login":"quoclong20222428","node_id":"U_kgDOBzjWkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/commit/0f36624d9741c314963e9e474a61fa94edd0de3f","node_id":"C_kwDOP7clw9oAKDBmMzY2MjRkOTc0MWMzMTQ5NjNlOWU0NzRhNjFmYTk0ZWRkMGRlM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/commit/795f2d89a0f4f9e4506e6af13b81c8b42c99fb59","sha":"795f2d89a0f4f9e4506e6af13b81c8b42c99fb59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/commits/795f2d89a0f4f9e4506e6af13b81c8b42c99fb59"}],"sha":"0f36624d9741c314963e9e474a61fa94edd0de3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/commits/0f36624d9741c314963e9e474a61fa94edd0de3f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121165459?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quoclong20222428","id":121165459,"login":"quoclong20222428","node_id":"U_kgDOBzjWkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/commits/795f2d89a0f4f9e4506e6af13b81c8b42c99fb59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-24T07:08:38Z","email":"4801104085@student.hcmue.edu.vn","name":"Long"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-24T07:08:38Z","email":"4801104085@student.hcmue.edu.vn","name":"Long"},"message":"fix: add missing @vitejs/plugin-react to vite config\n\n❌ Issue:\n- Vite config was missing React plugin configuration\n- Plugin was installed but not used in vite.config.ts\n- Local dev server worked due to relaxed validation\n- Production build (Vercel) failed to properly resolve import.meta.url in asset imports\n- Result: animated weather icons not displayed, import.meta.url paths broken\n\n✅ Solution:\n- Import @vitejs/plugin-react\n- Add react() to plugins array\n- Proper handling of JSX files and import.meta.url in assets\n\n🔧 Impact:\n- Fixes animated SVG icons not loading on Vercel\n- Ensures proper asset path resolution in production\n- Enables React Fast Refresh in dev server\n\n📝 Files:\n- vite.config.ts: Add react plugin configuration","tree":{"sha":"dc845b6bbd9fb803ec25c879d64f3c69dff9df72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/git/trees/dc845b6bbd9fb803ec25c879d64f3c69dff9df72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/git/commits/795f2d89a0f4f9e4506e6af13b81c8b42c99fb59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121165459?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quoclong20222428","id":121165459,"login":"quoclong20222428","node_id":"U_kgDOBzjWkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/commit/795f2d89a0f4f9e4506e6af13b81c8b42c99fb59","node_id":"C_kwDOP7clw9oAKDc5NWYyZDg5YTBmNGY5ZTQ1MDZlNmFmMTNiODFjOGI0MmM5OWZiNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/commit/d7a1b82b76246ce73dd9c0cd39efb03f78aadb05","sha":"d7a1b82b76246ce73dd9c0cd39efb03f78aadb05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/commits/d7a1b82b76246ce73dd9c0cd39efb03f78aadb05"}],"sha":"795f2d89a0f4f9e4506e6af13b81c8b42c99fb59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/commits/795f2d89a0f4f9e4506e6af13b81c8b42c99fb59"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121165459?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quoclong20222428","id":121165459,"login":"quoclong20222428","node_id":"U_kgDOBzjWkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/commits/d7a1b82b76246ce73dd9c0cd39efb03f78aadb05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T03:52:34Z","email":"4801104085@student.hcmue.edu.vn","name":"Long"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T03:52:34Z","email":"4801104085@student.hcmue.edu.vn","name":"Long"},"message":"fix: correct OAuth authentication flow to detect logged-in users properly\n\n❌ Issue:\n- Frontend OAuth callback expected ''token'' URL parameter but backend wasn''t sending it\n- Frontend checked for token parameter, so callback handler never executed\n- User remained undetected even though backend successfully authenticated\n- Frontend didn''t call /auth/me to verify server-side session\n\n✅ Solution:\n- Simplify OAuth callback: only check success=true flag\n- Call authApi.me() to fetch user data from server (using httpOnly cookie)\n- Remove dependency on URL parameters for sensitive token data\n- Fix AuthContext to verify user from server on app mount/reload\n\n🔄 Authentication Flow:\n1. User login via Google/GitHub OAuth\n2. Backend sets httpOnly cookies (auth_token + refresh_token)\n3. Backend redirects to /auth/callback?success=true\n4. Frontend detects success flag\n5. Frontend calls authApi.me() to fetch user data\n6. Frontend saves user to context + localStorage\n7. On page reload, AuthContext verifies session with server\n\n🔐 Security:\n- No token in URL (prevents logging/interception)\n- Token only in httpOnly cookies (XSS protection)\n- Server-side session verification always performed\n- Automatic sync between localStorage and server state\n\n📝 Changes:\n- Login.tsx: Remove token/provider/user URL parameter checks\n- Login.tsx: Call authApi.me() after OAuth callback\n- AuthContext: Add server-side session verification on mount\n- AuthContext: Auto-refresh user data from server if needed","tree":{"sha":"9a3223804c8977115eb45212ea29ef1adc238b2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/git/trees/9a3223804c8977115eb45212ea29ef1adc238b2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/git/commits/d7a1b82b76246ce73dd9c0cd39efb03f78aadb05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121165459?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://