ea chart with max/min values\n- Integrate recharts library for data visualization\n- Use dark theme matching Dashboard design (slate-900 palette)\n- Add getDailyWeatherByLatLon API method\n- Display 7-day forecast cards with date, icon, temperature, and rainfall\n- Cards use glassmorphism effect (20% opacity) to show chart underneath\n- Hide X/Y axis labels on rain chart for cleaner look\n- Add padding values (0) at chart edges for smoother visualization","tree":{"sha":"706cf7a57cd290be94c5000cc62f0dc03854a329","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/git/trees/706cf7a57cd290be94c5000cc62f0dc03854a329"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/git/commits/0bc02b9f3ede1caccc8e31855df75b828ec9af15","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121165459?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/quoclong20222428","id":121165459,"login":"quoclong20222428","node_id":"U_kgDOBzjWkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quoclong20222428","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/quoclong20222428/weather-forecast-fe/commit/0bc02b9f3ede1