ser}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blakster/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/blakster","id":118279381,"login":"blakster","node_id":"U_kgDOBwzM1Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blakster/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blakster/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blakster/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blakster/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blakster/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blakster","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blakster/OpenMRS/commits/1503144aef349d4d87f379b0f97e8b40013bdfba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T06:01:28Z","email":"118279381+blakster@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vansh Aggarwal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T06:01:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Cleaning up the patient dashboard\n\n* Add AGENTS.md with development environment setup instructions\n\nCo-authored-by: Vansh Aggarwal <blakster@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Update AGENTS.md: use yarn start:all for custom sidebar groups on port 8010\n\nCo-authored-by: Vansh Aggarwal <blakster@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Hide default sidebar tabs using provide() extension slot remove config\n\nRemoves the 11 default patient chart sidebar tabs (Patient Summary,\nVitals & Biometrics, Medications, Orders, Results, Visits, Allergies,\nConditions, Immunizations, Attachments, Programs) from the\npatient-chart-dashboard-slot using the O3 framework''s built-in\nprovide() configuration mechanism.\n\nCustom tabs (Intake, History, Assessment, Output groups and\nVoice Recordings) remain visible.\n\nCo-authored-by: Vansh Aggarwal <blakster@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Replace sidebar groups with flat tabs, add vitals action button\n\n- Remove collapsible groups (Intake, History, Assessment, Output)\n- Convert all hidden dashboard routes to flat createDashboardLink tabs\n- Remove Voice Recordings and Appointments from left sidebar\n- Add Voice Recordings to provide() remove list\n- Add Vitals & Biometrics action button to right action menu bar\n\nCo-authored-by: Vansh Aggarwal <blakster@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Also remove Appointments tab from sidebar via provide() config\n\nCo-authored-by: Vansh Aggarwal <blakster@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix TS errors: remove slot from createDashboardLink (provided by routes.json meta)\n\nCo-authored-by: Vansh Aggarwal <blakster@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Vansh Aggarwal <blakster@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"99995e0e9f2f9edd7600a4172069dc8bf7b76848","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blakster/OpenMRS/git/trees/99995e0e9f2f9edd7600a4172069dc8bf7b76848"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blakster/OpenMRS/git/commits/1503144aef349d4d87f379b0f97e8b40013bdfba","verification":{"payload":"tree 99995e0e9f2f9edd7600a4172069dc8bf7b76848\nparent d933d6ca220c10329a4db2c97e4f82ed00cdca08\nauthor Vansh Aggarwal <118279381+blakster@users.noreply.github.com> 1772863288 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772863288 +0530\n\nCleaning up the patient dashboard\n\n* Add AGENTS.md with development environment setup instructions\n\nCo-authored-by: Vansh Aggarwal <blakster@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Update AGENTS.md: use yarn start:all for custom sidebar groups on port 8010\n\nCo-authored-by: Vansh Aggarwal <blakster@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Hide default sidebar tabs using provide() extension slot remove config\n\nRemoves the 11 default patient chart sidebar tabs (Patient Summary,\nVitals & Biometrics, Medications, Orders, Results, Visits, Allergies,\nConditions, Immunizations, Attachments, Programs) from the\npatient-chart-dashboard-slot using the O3 framework''s built-in\nprovide() configuration mechanism.\n\nCustom tabs (Intake, History, Assessment, Output groups and\nVoice Recordings) remain visible.\n\nCo-authored-by: Vansh Aggarwal <blakster@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Replace sidebar groups with flat tabs, add vitals action button\n\n- Remove collapsible groups (Intake, History, Assessment, Output)\n- Convert all hidden dashboard routes to flat createDashboardLink tabs\n- Remove Voice Recordings and Appointments from left sidebar\n- Add Voice Recordings to provide() remove list\n- Add Vitals & Biometrics action button to right action menu bar\n\nCo-authored-by: Vansh Aggarwal <blakster@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Also remove Appointments tab from sidebar via provide() config\n\nCo-authored-by: Vansh Aggarwal <blakster@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix TS errors: remove slot from createDashboardLink (provided by routes.json meta)\n\nCo-authored-by: Vansh Aggarwal <blakster@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Vansh Aggarwal <blakster@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpq784CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiLwQAJP93e0bHePLkduyUnZEyLBS\nwUEkL5dC1ZgAjuO136UPC6fxm6dcYaL9fNvzEr4ddIG1l8Q+vZLL8up9BFJ0Dbnx\nPELz2xMLmtTyyIwRAqLjKvwGQSW8nRG1uKvLH78ZiRer++IiPfcQCXL2Pwp4cyoI\nNI34lYUqxN91+CW+MueIZgTfdcSZhRFtTS6WEYACuRJFRet197OPEdST3mwPVBsK\nJUuMCFAHBQwq8qTdZDGiSjnZWYRJsQKX++pO60E1QEgzBO3U96RzjOkamjMxlNzt\n0K5xtn6Iz23Cah4Ij7pckdijbFo6RNwh7lHzmujcXijpgtBYza9YdMEqFgZ5XGjY\ncUcMIiCGzZtwa/yKzqF0JZsa5XNbnKXD4ejmIDjIE1euSTh9mTTuN2/Ov0lPiK9Z\nzfB9ILYI/Kte7JfJT0bJb3LhZ8PXLjLWtRCOAypjSO/kWlz9JPsV50t+LvhMUZUD\nGT5/8uwtGBatS5TML9A2ZRQmRcdQGQ0vw70msWCRHLE5zB9J7ioN/vvg9iAUccCe\n7DPsjNVSiygml5V/yq3GDiqs6vr3xvV1dT50EWeaFg7PM3U6mTZP4vyuwH/th9g9\npEcyH0MxNAJp1I043bIF87jPoGAhf8v6PeqXV+5e1g1tZjwGD5WyQPoM7o+yS6mf\npmjnxbhA3fn1FFExfKqL\n=VRPA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-07T06:01:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar